    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<i>Welcome To Willbey School, A Place Once Known For Education And Joy.. Or Was It?</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peek a Doom</strong> is a <strong>first-person horror adventure</strong> set in the shadowy halls of Willby School. You play as <strong>Peter</strong>, a determined brother searching for his  missing sister in a place where reality bends, and every corner hides a secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve twisted puzzles, sneak through the darkness, and uncover a chilling mystery that goes deeper than anyone dares to admit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374710/extras/20c03e623d87dbf2ae423a45ef62e4f5.poster.avif?t=1755030280\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374710/extras/20c03e623d87dbf2ae423a45ef62e4f5.webm?t=1755030280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374710/extras/20c03e623d87dbf2ae423a45ef62e4f5.mp4?t=1755030280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374710/extras/e911234eb9b1b1d97dc3ca4bbed995dd.webp?t=1755030280\" width=616 height=7 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <i>Explore the Darkness</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through Willby's eerie classrooms, abandoned hallways, and off-limits zones as you solve the puzzles and piece together the truth behind your sister\u2019s abduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374710/extras/8ae524e8bc661062db7ffac99d570bb1.poster.avif?t=1755030280\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374710/extras/8ae524e8bc661062db7ffac99d570bb1.webm?t=1755030280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374710/extras/e911234eb9b1b1d97dc3ca4bbed995dd.webp?t=1755030280\" width=616 height=7 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <i>Uncover The Cult</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374710/extras/008847745ac672c394ae2edc4021633e.poster.avif?t=1755030280\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374710/extras/008847745ac672c394ae2edc4021633e.webm?t=1755030280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secret history of the school, the dark forces pulling the strings behind the scenes, and avoid being caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<i>Welcome To Willbey School, A Place Once Known For Education And Joy.. Or Was It?</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peek a Doom</strong> is a <strong>first-person horror adventure</strong> set in the shadowy halls of Willby School. You play as <strong>Peter</strong>, a determined brother searching for his  missing sister in a place where reality bends, and every corner hides a secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve twisted puzzles, sneak through the darkness, and uncover a chilling mystery that goes deeper than anyone dares to admit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374710/extras/20c03e623d87dbf2ae423a45ef62e4f5.poster.avif?t=1755030280\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374710/extras/20c03e623d87dbf2ae423a45ef62e4f5.webm?t=1755030280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374710/extras/20c03e623d87dbf2ae423a45ef62e4f5.mp4?t=1755030280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374710/extras/e911234eb9b1b1d97dc3ca4bbed995dd.webp?t=1755030280\" width=616 height=7 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <i>Explore the Darkness</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through Willby's eerie classrooms, abandoned hallways, and off-limits zones as you solve the puzzles and piece together t